-- 85% Less Damage
-- 60% Faster RoF
-- Ignites
-- 60% More RoF
-- 85% Less Damage
-- Alt Fire Disabled, Mag Reload
- Sith Blaster Rifle 
-- EE4 (2)
- Fire Grenades (2)


^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Environmental Protection (3)
- Assemble (2)

^3Abilities:
